Manage and select Confluent Cloud environments.

Usage:
  confluent environment [command]

Aliases:
  environment, env

Available Commands:
  create      Create an environment.
  delete      Delete one or more environments.
  describe    Describe an environment.
  list        List environments.
  update      Update an existing environment.
  use         Use an environment in subsequent commands.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent environment [command] --help" for more information about a command.
